#: SecretInputExtensions.cs
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Secrets.SecretInputViewModel"
msgid "Enter a value, or select a secret."
msgstr "输入一个值，或选择一个密钥。"

#: SecretInputExtensions.cs
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Secrets.SecretInputViewModel"
msgid "Select a secret."
msgstr "选择一个密钥。"

#. Format arguments: {0}: secretName
#: SecretInputExtensions.cs
#, csharp-format
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Secrets.SecretInputViewModel"
msgid "The secret '{0}' does not exist."
msgstr "密钥 '{0}' 不存在。"

#: TagHelpers/SecretInputTagHelper.cs
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Secrets.TagHelpers.SecretInputTagHelper"
msgid "Enter a new value"
msgstr "输入新值"

#: TagHelpers/SecretInputTagHelper.cs
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Secrets.TagHelpers.SecretInputTagHelper"
msgid ""
"The value is securely stored. Enter a new value to update it, or leave it "
"blank to keep it."
msgstr "此值已安全存储。输入新值以更新它，或留空以保留原值。"

#. Format arguments: {0}: model.Input.SecretName
#: TagHelpers/SecretInputTagHelper.cs
#, csharp-format
msgctxt "OrchardCore.Secrets.TagHelpers.SecretInputTagHelper"
msgid ""
"This setting references the secret '{0}', but the Secrets feature is not "
"enabled. Enable it, or enter a value to keep in these settings."
msgstr "此设置引用了密钥 '{0}'，但未启用 Secrets 功能。请启用该功能，或输入一个值以保留在这些设置中。"
